For a pair of distinct latents \eqn{(a, b)}, the double-mean centered
(DMC) product indicator is

\deqn{P = (fs_a - mi_a)(fs_b - mi_b) - mi_P}

where \eqn{mi_a} and \eqn{mi_b} are the SAMPLE means of the score
